WEBVTT

00:01:10.580 --> 00:01:17.090
<b>Pacific Ocean — S. Latitude
47.9, W. Longitude 126.43</b>

00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:36.070
At last, at last, at last!

00:01:36.070 --> 00:01:38.810
At last, Plan C will be complete.

00:01:38.810 --> 00:01:43.280
Revive, sunken city of R'lyeh!

00:01:43.280 --> 00:01:45.520
Great Cthulhu!

00:01:45.520 --> 00:01:47.520
Mighty Cthulhu...

00:01:47.520 --> 00:01:50.790
Ruler of the world, the god...

00:01:50.790 --> 00:01:52.990
Awaken from your long slumber,

00:01:52.990 --> 00:01:55.890
by the hand of Augustus.

00:01:55.890 --> 00:02:00.400
Yes, now I stand in the same place as the gods!

00:02:09.910 --> 00:02:11.880
<i>Come soon...</i>

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:15.870
<i>I'm here.</i>

00:02:37.400 --> 00:02:39.170
Princess...

00:02:39.170 --> 00:02:41.410
I'm sorry, Mr. Daijuji.

00:02:41.950 --> 00:02:44.640
For involving you in this.

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:46.470
What?

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:49.280
We just forced our way into it.

00:02:49.280 --> 00:02:52.710
You had your Demonbane taken
by some random person.

00:02:52.710 --> 00:02:53.760
You're a victim.

00:02:53.760 --> 00:02:55.920
Don't be so arrogant, girl.

00:02:55.920 --> 00:02:58.870
I'm merely doing my job.

00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:02.870
You're as foul-mouthed as ever.

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:05.630
Mr. Daijuji?

00:03:14.890 --> 00:03:15.970
Princess...

00:03:18.440 --> 00:03:20.220
Th-This is...

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:22.140
The Naacal Code's release key.

00:03:22.140 --> 00:03:24.000
I've moved it to you.

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:28.450
Now you can use Lemuria Impact
whenever you want.

00:03:28.450 --> 00:03:29.610
Princess...

00:03:29.610 --> 00:03:30.520
You...

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:36.500
Please protect the world's future.

00:03:37.660 --> 00:03:40.130
Lets go, Al!

00:03:40.130 --> 00:03:44.280
<i>Give me the wings that take
flight from frigid plains!</i>

00:03:46.100 --> 00:03:47.540
<i>Shantak!</i>

00:03:47.540 --> 00:03:50.010
Go!

00:03:55.780 --> 00:03:57.840
Out of the way!

00:04:00.450 --> 00:04:02.690
So, you've arrived, Demonbane?

00:04:02.690 --> 00:04:03.960
However...

00:04:16.350 --> 00:04:18.470
Deus Machina, Ogre.

00:04:18.470 --> 00:04:19.840
Here I go!

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:24.810
That voice... Titus?

00:04:30.380 --> 00:04:31.620
Prepare to die!

00:04:37.850 --> 00:04:39.020
An illusion?

00:04:39.020 --> 00:04:41.260
The Mirror of Nitocris?

00:04:42.040 --> 00:04:44.930
I see... It was him?

00:04:45.650 --> 00:04:47.660
<i>Lemuria...</i>

00:04:47.660 --> 00:04:50.230
Let us finish this, Demonbane!

00:04:50.230 --> 00:04:52.210
<i>...Impact!</i>

00:04:58.170 --> 00:04:59.550
Splendid...

00:05:13.560 --> 00:05:16.370
Demonbane has defeated
the enemy Deus Machina,

00:05:16.370 --> 00:05:18.860
and entered the Dream Heart Mother.

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:21.250
Mr. Daijuji.

00:05:35.540 --> 00:05:38.720
We'll protect this ship in
my darling's place-robo!

00:05:38.720 --> 00:05:40.220
That's right!

00:05:41.050 --> 00:05:44.840
As long as you've got the ultimate
tag team of Elsa and me,

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:47.180
no one in all the seven seas can face us.

00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:50.110
I'll be with you forever.

00:05:50.110 --> 00:05:52.400
I'm so happy...

00:05:57.340 --> 00:05:58.520
This is...

00:05:58.520 --> 00:05:59.940
Kuro, look!

00:06:03.650 --> 00:06:06.300
Wh-What is that?!

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:11.080
You're here, Demonbane?

00:06:11.890 --> 00:06:13.600
Anticross?

00:06:14.150 --> 00:06:15.790
Anticross?

00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:18.890
That word no longer has any meaning.

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:23.480
I have mastered even the
Great Old Ones' power.

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:26.000
Now I am as a god!

00:06:30.130 --> 00:06:31.870
He's mad!

00:06:33.030 --> 00:06:37.610
So basically, if I beat you, it's all over?

00:06:39.700 --> 00:06:41.330
Beat me?

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:43.930
Defeat the Legacy of Gold?

00:06:43.930 --> 00:06:46.050
Laughable!

00:06:49.020 --> 00:06:52.350
Know your place, little fly!

00:07:01.140 --> 00:07:02.800
H-He's strong...

00:07:02.800 --> 00:07:06.770
No attack can match Cthulhu's power.

00:07:06.770 --> 00:07:09.540
Now, kneel before me!

00:07:09.540 --> 00:07:12.880
Fall prostrate before the
Emperor of Earth, Augustus!

00:07:49.180 --> 00:07:51.710
What just happened?

00:08:01.150 --> 00:08:05.400
Jeez... Augustus was getting out of control.

00:08:05.400 --> 00:08:07.720
And I went through all the trouble

00:08:07.720 --> 00:08:10.130
of returning, to help him revive Cthulhu.

00:08:12.120 --> 00:08:14.870
Impossible! That's...

00:08:14.870 --> 00:08:17.040
Hey, Kuro!

00:08:17.040 --> 00:08:17.880
How have you been?

00:08:17.880 --> 00:08:19.340
Ennea?

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:24.500
Sorry... That name was a lie.

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:26.320
My real name is Nero.

00:08:29.700 --> 00:08:31.260
The Tyrant Nero.

00:08:31.260 --> 00:08:34.230
Nero of Anticross.

00:08:34.230 --> 00:08:36.690
Wh-What?

00:08:38.090 --> 00:08:42.800
Looks like you've mastered
both the guns I gave you.

00:08:42.800 --> 00:08:46.430
You gave us these? Why?

00:08:46.430 --> 00:08:49.230
You seemed to be having a hard time.

00:08:49.240 --> 00:08:51.040
Useful, weren't they?

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:54.910
Ennea, you... What are you...

00:08:54.910 --> 00:08:56.920
I told you!

00:08:56.920 --> 00:08:59.230
It's not Ennea. It's Nero.

00:08:59.230 --> 00:09:00.380
Anticross.

00:09:00.380 --> 00:09:02.850
Your enemy.

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:09.290
You and I will destroy each other here.

00:09:09.290 --> 00:09:13.360
You, the hero who protects Arkham City.

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:17.840
And I, the evil wizard who plots
to destroy the world.

00:09:17.840 --> 00:09:22.340
We'll put everything we have
into denying the other!

00:09:22.340 --> 00:09:23.780
Wonderful, isn't it?

00:09:23.780 --> 00:09:25.820
Wh-What?

00:09:25.820 --> 00:09:29.450
Why do I have to do that?!

00:09:29.450 --> 00:09:30.970
Why?

00:09:30.970 --> 00:09:32.350
Because I want to.

00:09:33.580 --> 00:09:36.590
I know you can do it.

00:09:42.270 --> 00:09:43.280
Hey!

00:09:43.280 --> 00:09:44.300
Kuro!

00:09:44.970 --> 00:09:47.060
<i>Spell Selection: Bullet Spell.</i>

00:09:56.090 --> 00:09:59.240
<i>Spell Selection: Sword Spell!</i>

00:10:00.810 --> 00:10:02.550
<i>S-Scimitar of Barzai!</i>

00:10:08.520 --> 00:10:10.780
What's wrong, Kuro?

00:10:10.780 --> 00:10:12.760
If you just stand there, I'll kill you!

00:10:14.830 --> 00:10:17.690
Ennea... Are you serious?

00:10:17.690 --> 00:10:19.700
Are you really saying this?!

00:10:19.700 --> 00:10:21.310
That's right.

00:10:21.310 --> 00:10:23.100
I'm a demon.

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:26.200
So to me, killing and destroying are fun.

00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:27.870
What about you?

00:10:27.870 --> 00:10:30.420
Will you let me destroy you?

00:10:33.630 --> 00:10:38.030
Destroy each other... You and me?

00:10:38.840 --> 00:10:40.650
No way.

00:10:41.310 --> 00:10:43.650
The smile you showed me...

00:10:44.300 --> 00:10:47.160
Those words... Were they all lies?

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:51.190
Then why come to us at all?!

00:10:51.190 --> 00:10:52.800
Answer me, demon Nero!

00:10:52.800 --> 00:10:54.530
Calm down, Kuro!

00:10:54.530 --> 00:10:56.380
I...

00:10:57.500 --> 00:10:59.970
I just wanted to see you...

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:01.260
That's the truth.

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:05.610
I had fun playing with you and Al.

00:11:05.610 --> 00:11:07.950
Lots of fun...

00:11:07.950 --> 00:11:09.650
That's the truth, too.

00:11:09.650 --> 00:11:11.320
Then why?

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:13.280
Fight, Kuro.

00:11:13.950 --> 00:11:16.730
The evil you must destroy is here.

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:20.140
I don't understand...

00:11:20.140 --> 00:11:24.510
It was promised that the
Black Lodge would be mine.

00:11:26.050 --> 00:11:28.800
I don't understand at all!

00:11:28.800 --> 00:11:32.340
I am the one who releases Cthulhu
and destroys the world!

00:11:32.340 --> 00:11:36.190
I am the evil and the unfairness that you hate.

00:11:36.770 --> 00:11:40.610
You're fighting to destroy me.

00:11:40.610 --> 00:11:44.730
That's not what I'm fighting for at all.

00:11:44.730 --> 00:11:49.550
I'm not fighting to cover up
unfairness with more unfairness!

00:11:50.740 --> 00:11:51.990
I see...

00:11:51.990 --> 00:11:53.990
Then I guess I have no choice.

00:11:57.100 --> 00:11:59.250
Access the <i>R'lyeh Text</i>.

00:11:59.250 --> 00:12:02.000
Order: Surpass Limit C.

00:12:07.440 --> 00:12:09.370
Wh-What is this?

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:11.880
<i>Cthulhu R'lyeh...</i>

00:12:11.880 --> 00:12:13.740
What are you planning?

00:12:13.740 --> 00:12:16.400
I'm going to turn off the control.

00:12:16.400 --> 00:12:18.080
<i>The god...</i>

00:12:26.090 --> 00:12:28.670
The god has gone out of control.

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:35.420
The cells of the god are expanding
without limit.

00:12:35.910 --> 00:12:39.010
Like cancer!

00:12:39.010 --> 00:12:42.580
A great cancer, eating away at great Cthulhu.

00:12:42.580 --> 00:12:45.710
Yes, that is Big C.

00:12:45.710 --> 00:12:47.650
No...

00:12:48.630 --> 00:12:50.620
<i>Mr. Daijuji...</i>

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:51.920
<i>Al Azif...</i>

00:12:52.940 --> 00:12:55.700
See? If it keeps growing out of control,

00:12:55.700 --> 00:12:57.990
Cthulhu will cover the whole planet.

00:12:57.990 --> 00:13:01.130
The entire world will be polluted
with its miasma.

00:13:01.130 --> 00:13:03.930
And the world's history will end.

00:13:05.730 --> 00:13:07.360
How awful...

00:13:10.780 --> 00:13:14.910
That is what I do!

00:13:18.820 --> 00:13:20.940
You finally ready?

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:22.810
Kuro, we're fighting!

00:13:22.810 --> 00:13:23.550
Al...

00:13:23.550 --> 00:13:26.440
<i>There are those we cannot save,
except by fighting.</i>

00:13:26.440 --> 00:13:27.280
Al, I...

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:31.210
<i>No number of words will save them.</i>

00:13:31.210 --> 00:13:33.020
<i>Yes, not even the enemy!</i>

00:13:33.520 --> 00:13:34.860
Ennea...

00:13:34.990 --> 00:13:39.800
Hey, you'd better hurry, or you
won't be able to stop Cthulhu!

00:13:41.730 --> 00:13:42.830
I...

00:13:43.370 --> 00:13:45.800
Are you okay with this?

00:13:45.800 --> 00:13:47.670
It's all going to disappear.

00:13:47.670 --> 00:13:49.410
The towns, the people...

00:13:49.410 --> 00:13:50.040
Everything you care about!

00:13:52.280 --> 00:13:54.280
I don't care.

00:13:54.280 --> 00:13:55.780
That's right.

00:13:56.270 --> 00:14:00.880
I want this whole world destroyed!

00:14:01.720 --> 00:14:02.790
Kuro!

00:14:17.890 --> 00:14:19.200
This is...

00:14:29.900 --> 00:14:32.820
Yes... That's right, Kuro.

00:14:38.920 --> 00:14:41.020
If your own power won't suffice,

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:43.350
you'll use Kuro's human power.

00:14:43.350 --> 00:14:45.260
Within this infinite loop,

00:14:45.260 --> 00:14:49.240
that's the answer you finally found.

00:14:49.770 --> 00:14:51.270
Impressive.

00:14:52.300 --> 00:14:53.640
But you know...

00:14:53.640 --> 00:14:55.970
Humans are strong...

00:14:55.970 --> 00:14:58.410
Truly strong...

00:14:58.410 --> 00:15:00.880
Far stronger than you think.

00:15:01.310 --> 00:15:05.290
So that strength will be your undoing!

00:15:08.220 --> 00:15:12.850
The Shining Trapezohedron...
It's moving on its own again!

00:15:12.850 --> 00:15:14.520
What is this?

00:15:17.770 --> 00:15:19.600
Now, come, Kuro!

00:15:25.780 --> 00:15:29.510
Now... Now it can end...

00:15:42.490 --> 00:15:43.620
Kuro...

00:15:43.620 --> 00:15:49.480
It isn't you, Ennea, that I...
That Demonbane will slay.

00:15:52.010 --> 00:15:54.900
Demonbane is the demon-slaying blade.

00:15:54.900 --> 00:15:57.900
I will slay only evil here!

00:16:01.650 --> 00:16:03.910
Hey, you little troublemaker.

00:16:03.910 --> 00:16:06.040
We're going back to the office.

00:16:07.100 --> 00:16:09.410
That's where you belong.

00:16:12.400 --> 00:16:14.420
I don't like it, but it can't be helped.

00:16:15.080 --> 00:16:17.020
But I'm Nero...

00:16:17.020 --> 00:16:18.140
No.

00:16:19.420 --> 00:16:23.240
I defeated the last member of Anticross, Nero.

00:16:23.240 --> 00:16:25.700
It's just Ennea now.

00:16:26.450 --> 00:16:28.180
Let's say that.

00:16:28.180 --> 00:16:30.760
I can't.

00:16:30.760 --> 00:16:32.410
It's not true.

00:16:32.410 --> 00:16:33.790
Yeah...

00:16:33.790 --> 00:16:34.930
But...

00:16:34.930 --> 00:16:35.710
But?

00:16:37.710 --> 00:16:40.020
But I can't believe

00:16:40.020 --> 00:16:43.000
you're evil enough that you must be destroyed.

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:44.690
Kuro...

00:16:44.690 --> 00:16:46.220
You are strong.

00:16:46.220 --> 00:16:48.610
Wh-What's this, all of sudden?

00:16:48.610 --> 00:16:50.260
You really are strong.

00:16:50.260 --> 00:16:52.200
Far stronger than Nero thought.

00:16:52.200 --> 00:16:54.290
It's not Nero...

00:16:54.290 --> 00:16:58.720
By meeting you, Nero wanted to
get some of your courage.

00:16:58.720 --> 00:17:01.740
The courage to destroy herself.

00:17:01.740 --> 00:17:04.080
Ennea, you...

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:05.360
But she was wrong!

00:17:05.360 --> 00:17:07.450
That wasn't strength.

00:17:07.450 --> 00:17:08.840
It was just running.

00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:10.810
You still...

00:17:13.290 --> 00:17:18.080
If there's a next time, Nero
will be even stronger.

00:17:18.080 --> 00:17:21.940
So even if she's struggling, at despair's edge,
she can still say she's alive.

00:17:21.940 --> 00:17:23.750
She can still be proud.

00:17:23.750 --> 00:17:25.190
Thank you,

00:17:25.190 --> 00:17:27.260
Ennea's beloved Kuro.

00:17:27.260 --> 00:17:28.710
Ennea!

00:17:30.260 --> 00:17:35.840
And I'm going to ruin the
clothes you bought me...

00:17:35.840 --> 00:17:37.070
I'm sorry.

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:08.550
This is our first meeting, yes?

00:18:08.550 --> 00:18:09.970
Kuro Daijuji.

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:27.450
Just as I promised last time,
I have shown myself.

00:18:27.890 --> 00:18:30.450
You were alive?!

00:18:30.450 --> 00:18:32.020
Alive?

00:18:32.020 --> 00:18:33.780
That's incorrect.

00:18:33.780 --> 00:18:37.960
Just now, I was birthed by my mother, Nero.

00:18:38.700 --> 00:18:40.460
You bastard!

00:18:40.460 --> 00:18:47.970
Yes. I was born to fight you,
at this moment, in this place!

00:18:52.120 --> 00:18:54.010
You're here, Etheldreda?

00:18:54.010 --> 00:18:55.560
The Liber Legis?

00:18:55.560 --> 00:18:56.510
The <i>Pnakotic Manuscripts</i>!

00:18:58.410 --> 00:18:59.910
Yes, master.

00:18:59.910 --> 00:19:00.910
I have come.

00:19:06.590 --> 00:19:12.560
I shall now tell you the true goal of Plan C!

00:19:25.240 --> 00:19:28.890
Come to me, god who is both key and gate.

00:19:29.580 --> 00:19:31.250
Come...

00:19:40.290 --> 00:19:44.290
The All-in-One and One-in-All.

00:19:44.290 --> 00:19:46.460
Come to me!

00:19:46.460 --> 00:19:49.750
My father, Yog-Sothoth!

00:19:59.810 --> 00:20:01.730
Wh-What?

00:20:01.730 --> 00:20:02.510
Impossible...

00:20:02.510 --> 00:20:06.950
The key and guardian of the gate,
who exists in all space-time.

00:20:06.950 --> 00:20:12.960
Gate which leads to the Outer Universe,
where the Great Old Ones abide, Yog-Sothoth.

00:20:12.960 --> 00:20:15.320
Dark god of the other worlds...

00:20:15.320 --> 00:20:20.000
No mere human could summon such a thing!

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:23.500
It can't be... Master Therion, he is...

00:20:23.500 --> 00:20:27.320
Yes. I bear within me Yog-Sothoth's blood.

00:20:43.490 --> 00:20:46.890
I am born of a forbidden coupling,

00:20:46.890 --> 00:20:52.400
between the strongest
human mage, Nero, and an outer god.

00:20:52.400 --> 00:20:54.500
The child of an evil god.

00:20:55.200 --> 00:20:58.240
The child of a god...

00:20:58.240 --> 00:21:02.240
Now, can you defeat me?

00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:04.410
Me, the child of a god?

00:21:06.330 --> 00:21:11.950
God-Slaying Blade, Kuro Daijuji!

00:22:55.090 --> 00:22:57.950
Give a steel will to the hearts of man.

00:22:57.950 --> 00:23:00.420
Give the pulse of life to a blade of steel.

00:23:00.420 --> 00:23:03.620
And unending love to our bond!

00:23:03.620 --> 00:23:06.300
Final Episode: Strange Eons.

00:23:06.300 --> 00:23:10.190
We are a bird, taking flight,
wings spread out to fly to tomorrow.
